    "",
    "They are NOT removed. The section 4 sample is pre-committed and stays exactly as drawn, all 220",
    "rows, and PRIMARY is the reading over all of it. This file exists so that every DEV and HOLDOUT",
    "reading can also be reported with these rows excluded — SENSITIVITY — and so the harness can",
    "notice if the count changes.",
    "",
    "All 23 frame rows are listed, not only the 4 that were drawn, because the population estimate",
    "reweights by stratum: dropping sample rows without dropping the frame rows they stand for would",
    "make the sensitivity reading estimate a corpus that does not exist.",
    "",
    "Fingerprints only. The bodies and the ids stay out, same rule as every other file here."
  ],
